  "description": "Notification Center: infrastruktur notifikasi terpusat (in-app realtime via Reverb + email sistem) untuk trigger lumrah ERP — approve/reject dokumen, role-based document alert, auth (reset password/invite/verify), dan pola umum ERPNext/Odoo lainnya. Satu Notification class per event, multi-channel (mail + database + broadcast)."
